name va-shadow-implicit
# A verb synset (BabelNet's key of it, read as the ILI concept), a role of its frame, and the synsets that fill the
# role as a shadow argument (VA_bn2shadow) or an implicit one (VA_bn2implicit), as the file's name says: the row says
# together that the synset has the role as such an argument, and what fills it.
match VA_bn2shadow.tsv VA_bn2implicit.tsv
grammar table
skip 1
columns synset role filler
list filler |
type synset ili
type filler ili
claims
together
predicate-in-name 2 .
subject in synset
object in role
claims
together
subject in synset
predicate in role
object in filler
